WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Find the actor’s card.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.800
Hold the card and drag it into the outlined role.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.100
Release. Gosling’s headshot now fills the Sam Vimes slot.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.350
On a phone, hold the Drag handle on the actor’s card.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.667
Slide your finger into the slot, then lift to cast.
